Fugløy's patch to xtrs (emu phase 7, Model I differential harness), applied by
`pnpm xtrs:install` (scripts/install-xtrs.sh) with `git apply` to
https://github.com/TimothyPMann/xtrs at 3a2180c063811a715faa28d39a94739c33e0abd0.

It changes nothing in xtrs's emulation. It only exports what a driver stepping
one instruction at a time needs and the files keep `static`: the interrupt check
z80_run makes after each instruction (z80.c), a setter and a side-effect-free
read for the keyboard matrix (trs_keyboard.c), and the same for the Model I's
interrupt latch at $37E0 (trs_interrupt.c). The driver is
packages/emu/scripts/xtrs/fugloy-xtrs.c.

